### The company's concurrent dialer calls: limit, active, available
GET http://localhost:8080/api/concurrency
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### SIP trunks: channel limit, calls on them now, and the channel count learned from refusals
GET http://localhost:8080/api/concurrency/trunks
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### A campaign's dialing capacity: company limit, its own and other campaigns' share, trunk CPS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/concurrency/campaigns/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
